* Fibonacci numbers calculator

********************************************************************************
.DATA
********************************************************************************

********************************************************************************
.CODE
********************************************************************************
* Calculate Fibonacci(N) with Fibonacci(0) = 0 and Fibonacci(1) = 1.
* R0 is the previous term, R1 the current term, and R2 counts down from N.
START   LI      R0, d0
        LI      R1, d1
        LI      R2, d17
        LI      R3, d1

FIBLOOP CMP     R2, R3
        BRC     FIBDONE, 00
        LR      R4, R0
        ADD     R4, R1
        LR      R0, R1
        LR      R1, R4
        SUBI    R2, d1
        BRU     FIBLOOP

FIBDONE LR      R0, R1
        EXIT
